        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Events and Event Handling\n\nOccurrences, subscriptions, and handlers in Twilite scripting.\n\n**Scope:** Event identity, payload, emission, subscriptions, handler invocation, ordering, and failure isolation.\n\nFollow the Topic and its linked concepts to inspect the model."
        },
